# r28-goal-stale-order-prevention: R28. Stale Goal Nudge Ordering & Stuck-Busy Escalation Prevention.
# Reproduces incident multiple-20260915-105755:
#   1. Out-of-order resurrection: Nudge 49 resurrected and surfaced AFTER Nudges 50-52
#      because allIdleSinceAt was cleared by root_busy, causing staleSurfaceReason to fail to suppress.
#   2. Unconsumed stale messages in mailbox inflated oldestWaitMs >= 120s, triggering false
#      stuck-busy escalation and interrupting an actively working Root.
#
# Pattern 2 (seeded world + single-actor script):
# The fixture scripts the Root agent verifying mailbox contents. Older superseded nudges
# are retired into consumerReceipts and never surfaced out of order.
